# ISP Platform sample metadata.
# CLI: copy this file into the study directory as metadata.tsv, then edit the rows.
# sample-id must match each sample folder name.
# Required columns: sample-id, disease, species.
# species is mouse, human, or drosophila, and must be the same on every row.
# It must also match species.model_organism.
# Add any further columns you need (experiment, replicate, batch, ...).
sample-id	disease	species	experiment
sample_S01	Matrigel	human	Somatoid
sample_S02	NoMatrigel	human	Somatoid
